From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: PathOps <noreply@pathops.dev>
Date: Mon, 23 Nov 2026 01:23:21 -0300
Subject: [PATCH 7/7] delegation: show PathOps Routes and the Routes parameter
 update on the consent screen

PathOps Decision 0067 adds Application Routes to the create-app plan and
a CREATE_ROUTES operation. A pathops_route detail (tool "pathops") names
a Route, whether it is the Application's default and its hostname in
each Environment, with the action reserve. The Routes parameter of an
Application's Preflight (ConfigMap pathops-routes) is a Kubernetes
object detail that may also carry the action update and its exact
allowedHosts. The consent screen shows each Route with its hostnames,
and the object's allowed hostnames, instead of other resources.
---
